# Live Instagram feed for the @bommienoosa grid.
# 1. Create a free feed at https://behold.so and connect the @bommienoosa account
#    (Instagram needs to be a Business or Creator account; switching is free in the app).
# 2. Choose the "JSON" feed type and copy its URL.
# 3. Copy this file to .env and paste the URL below, then restart `npm run dev`.
#    On your host (Vercel, Netlify, etc.) add the same variable in the project settings.
VITE_INSTAGRAM_FEED_URL=
